1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,991
In the ruined temple outside the city, a single oil lamp was burning.

2
00:00:06,391 --> 00:00:09,920
Miss Shen, so you came after all.

3
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:13,710
Let the child go. I'm the one you want.

4
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:19,126
Let him go? Do you know how many years I've waited for this day?

5
00:00:20,126 --> 00:00:23,609
Ten years of debt, settled tonight!

6
00:00:25,609 --> 00:00:35,268
Before she finished, a gust of wind blew out the lamp. In the dark, there was only the sound of blades leaving their sheaths.

7
00:00:35,668 --> 00:00:40,544
Your... your sword, how can it be so fast!
